Portions of vqs/policy.py, vqs/evidence.py and vqs/pbir.py were adapted from
PBIPDocumenter (https://github.com/analienx/pbidocumenter), specifically its
Visual Quality System and quality-gate implementation in draft PR #12,
prototype commit 99ae076. This extraction changes the Python package layout,
removes PBIPDocumenter-specific imports, adds stricter portable CLI inputs,
and documents its current pre-alpha limitations. The source project carries
Apache License 2.0; see the LICENSE file in this repository.

External projects mentioned in documentation (Fab Inspector, Draco 2, Power BI
Desktop Bridge CLI, Microsoft's authoring and modeling tools) are NOT vendored
or included as binaries in this repository. Their own license terms, trademarks
and optional runtime requirements remain with their respective authors.
